@startuml
title Zenval — PostgreSQL schema hiện tại
caption IMPLEMENTED — source snapshot 2026-11-07
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
hide empty methods
entity "ledger.business_event" as E {
  * id : uuid <<PK>>
  --
  * workspace_id : uuid
  * event_type : text
  * occurred_at : timestamptz
  * posted_at : timestamptz
  --
  UNIQUE(id, workspace_id)
  INDEX(workspace_id, posted_at)
}
entity "ledger.ledger_entry" as L {
  * id : uuid <<PK>>
  --
  * business_event_id : uuid <<FK>>
  * workspace_id : uuid <<composite FK>>
  * account_id : uuid
  * amount : numeric(38,12)
  * currency : text
  --
  CHECK currency ~ '^[A-Z]{3}$' (SQL)
  INDEX(workspace_id, business_event_id)
}
E ||--o{ L : event ID FK + (event ID, workspace ID) FK
note bottom of E
  Exact source: packages/database/src/schema.ts
  + migrations/0001_ledger_foundation.sql
  + migrations/0002_ledger_workspace_integrity.sql.
  All listed columns NOT NULL. No account/IAM table or account FK yet.
  Database permits zero entries; balancing/minimum entry count is not a DB constraint.
  Currency CHECK exists in SQL migration, not in Drizzle schema.ts.
  Target timestamps/version/idempotency/outbox/FX fields are absent here.
end note
legend bottom
  COMPLIANCE GAP: current schema stores raw financial columns.
  Required encryption gateway/storage migration is NOT implemented.
endlegend
